<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 14,000 T of white sugar for August -T.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 14,000 T of white sugar for August -T.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought a cargo of 14,000 tonnes 45 ICUMSA white sugar for shipment in August 1997 at a snap tender on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The price was not disclosed. --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
